  <article class="legal-page"><div class="legal-page__content shell"><p class="eyebrow">Website policy</p><h1>Website terms</h1><p>Last reviewed: 1 September 2026</p><p>The information on this website helps guests understand Orchha Palace before moving into the live booking or enquiry process. Room availability, event availability, prices, inclusions and policies remain subject to confirmation.</p><h2>Room information</h2><p>Room photographs represent the stated category but individual rooms, views, furnishings and layouts can vary. Only the confirmed booking record establishes the room, dates, inclusions and price.</p><h2>Venue information</h2><p>Event capacities depend on the final layout, stage, catering, production, safety and circulation requirements. Outdoor capacities are confirmed by the events team after reviewing the brief.</p><h2>External services</h2><p>Booking, payment, maps, WhatsApp and other linked services operate under their own terms. Orchha Palace is not responsible for temporary availability or content changes on third-party services.</p><h2>Accuracy</h2><p>The hotel aims to keep information current. If website content differs from a written booking or event confirmation, the latest written confirmation from the hotel controls.</p></div></article>
